{"title":"라이드 온 킹 [단행본]","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=bJXmCo/dJMcablnIak/MZyockjHz1whmPSgYTYeMK&filename=th3","synopsis":"국민의 전폭적인 지지를 받고 있는 남자이자 푸르지아 왕국의 종신 대통령 알렉산드르 푸르치노프.\n그는 무술격투기의 달인이자 어딘가에 타는 것을 미친듯이 좋아하는 '기승욕'이 강한 사람이었다.\n어느 날 테러리스트의 습격을 받게 된 그는 돌진해오는 테러리스트를 가뿐히 처리했으나\n예상치 못한 사건으로 정신을 잃고 만다.\n눈을 뜬 대통령 앞에 펼쳐진 광경은 인간과 몬스터가 공존하는 다른 세계였는데?!\n어디로 튈 지 모르는 종신 대통령 푸르치노프의 앞을 예측할 수 없는 이세계 판타지!\n\n\nTHE RIDE-ON KINGⓒYasushi Baba 2019.\nAll rights reserved.\nFirst published in Japan in 2019 by Kodansha Ltd., Tokyo\nElectronic Publishing rights for this Korean edition arranged through Kodansha Ltd.","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-10-09","rank":29,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-10","rank":168,"change":{"type":"down","amount":139}},{"date":"2026-10-11","rank":200,"change":{"type":"down","amount":32}},{"date":"2026-10-12","rank":216,"change":{"type":"down","amount":16}},{"date":"2026-10-13","rank":240,"change":{"type":"down","amount":24}},{"date":"2026-10-14","rank":270,"change":{"type":"down","amount":30}}],"weekly":[{"date":"2026-10-09","rank":68,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-10","rank":63,"change":{"type":"up","amount":5}},{"date":"2026-10-11","rank":61,"change":{"type":"up","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-10-12","rank":61,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-13","rank":61,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-14","rank":56,"change":{"type":"up","amount":5}},{"date":"2026-10-15","rank":60,"change":{"type":"down","amount":4}},{"date":"2026-10-16","rank":240,"change":{"type":"down","amount":180}},{"date":"2026-10-17","rank":265,"change":{"type":"down","amount":25}},{"date":"2026-10-18","rank":267,"change":{"type":"down","amount":2}}],"monthly":[{"date":"2026-10-09","rank":166,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-10","rank":160,"change":{"type":"up","amount":6}},{"date":"2026-10-11","rank":160